    "Name": "Cavalry Attack Helicopter",
    "Details": "The Cavalry Infiltrator uses advanced technology to deploy battle armor into combat at blistering speed. Featuring a Jet booster, Guardian ECM, Stealth Armor and a pair of Magshots in a Chin Turret it's the envy of many Inner Sphere forces. Cal-Boeing however has no plans to sell it outside the Federated Suns.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 10/15 hexes / 300/450 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Vehicle Stealth Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       100     18\n<b>Left</b>          80     18\n<b>Right</b>        80     18\n<b>Rear</b>         80     18\n<b>Turret</b>       15     18\n\n<b>Total</b>      355     90</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Can carry 1 Battle Armor Squads.</color>",
